{"height": 12, "weight": 203, "base_experience": 169, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "speed", "value": 2}], "genus": "Long Tail Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 100, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "fast", "egg_groups": ["ground"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "エテボース"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Eteboth"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "겟핸보숭"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "雙尾怪手"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Capidextre"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Ambidiffel"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Ambipom"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Ambipom"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "エテボース"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "双尾怪手"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Ambipom"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["diamond", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "To eat, it deftly shucks nuts with its two tails. It rarely uses its arms now."}, {"versions": ["pearl", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "They work in large colonies and make rings by linking their tails, apparently in friendship."}, {"versions": ["platinum"], "text": "Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, AMBIPOM rarely uses its hands."}, {"versions": ["heartgold"], "text": "They live on large trees. They are said to communicate by connecting their tails to those of others."}, {"versions": ["soulsilver"], "text": "It is very difficult to dodge the consecutive strikes of its two tails."}, {"versions": ["black", "white", "black-2", "white-2"], "text": "Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "In their search for comfortable trees, they get into territorial disputes with groups of Passimian. They win about half the time."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "It uses its tails for everything. If it wraps both of its tails around you and gives you a squeeze, that’s proof it really likes you."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "To affirm their kinship, mem